ആറ് bowl ID-കളുടെ dynamic order stdin-ൽ നിന്ന് വായിച്ച് Appendix A-യിലെ circular prev/current/next topology ഓരോ position 1..6-ലും output ചെയ്യുന്ന clean Stage 1 probe. position 1-ന്റെ prev position 6 ആണ്; position 6-ന്റെ next position 1 ആണ്. fixture order 3,1,6,2,5,4 ആണെങ്കിൽ outputs: 4,3,1, 3,1,6, 1,6,2, 6,2,5, 2,5,4, 5,4,3.

Hamlet, order position 1 സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, order position 2 സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, order position 3 സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, order position 4 സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, order position 5 സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Lady Macbeth, order position 6 സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Prospero, input-output സഹായിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: dynamic order വായിക്കുന്നു.

Scene I: positions 1..3.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: positions 4..6.
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]

Act II: circular neighbor triples.

Scene I: position 1 = prev6,current1,next2.
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: position 2 = prev1,current2,next3.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: position 3 = prev2,current3,next4.
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: position 4 = prev3,current4,next5.
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene V: position 5 = prev4,current5,next6.
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene VI: position 6 = prev5,current6,next1.
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
